! n-butanol, n-heptane and iso-octane mechanism
! 2013-07-16 WJP: added iso-octane to nc12_Villano12_mech from C. K. Westbrook
! iso-octane chemistry from ic8_ver3_mech.txt
! Includes new R+O2 chemistry for n-heptane from Villano, S. M., L. K. Huynh, H.-H. Carstensen and A. M. Dean (2012, 2013)

!  ************************************************************************************
!
!        combined n-alkane mechanism for n-dodecane and n-butanol mechanism
!
!        n-dodecane mechanism taken from 2-methyl alkane mechanism (Sarathy et al., 2010, and 2011)
!         with all large 2-methyl alkanes removed, 
!         large n-alkanes larger than n-c13 also removed
!         to take advantage of n-alkane improvements following n-alkane 
!         paper (Westbrook et al., Combustion and Flame 156, 181-199, 2009)
!
!         n-butanol taken from butanol isomers paper of Sarathy et al., 2011, to be submitted.
!
!         C0 - C4 submechanism from Curran, Metcalfe et al., version xxx, dated xx/xx/xx.
!
!  ************************************************************************************
elements
c h n o ar he

end
