ic3h7cho+h<=>ic4h8oh-1 8.000e+12 0.000 9.500e+03 !!ref:analogy with ch3choh --> ch3cho + h. Natarajan & Bhaskaran Symp. Intl. Shock 13
!
!ic4h8oh-2
